@startuml
[*] --> StartupCheck
StartupCheck --> Ready : everythingOK
StartupCheck --> Stop : problemDuringStartup
Ready --> Ready : userReset
Ready --> Activated : userActivate
Ready --> Stopped : userTurnOff
Activated --> Monitoring
Monitoring --> Alarm : sensorTriggered
Alarm --> Monitoring : falseAlarm
Alarm --> Monitoring : timeEnds
Monitoring --> Stopped : userPassword
Stopped --> [*]
@enduml
